XML/issues/2755#issuecomment-3168594940","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2755","id":3168594940,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE8683Ov8","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-08T16:33:45Z","updated_at":"2025-08-08T16:33:45Z","body":"Taking a look at the discussion in https://gitlab.com/fedora/legal/fedora-license-data/-/issues/663, it sounds like this license has been accepted for inclusion in Fedora, just pending the SPDX ID.\n\nI'm +1 to add it. Fine with the proposed ID.\n\nWhile I'm also personally fine with the proposed name, in order to align with past practices for [`WTFPL`](https://spdx.org/licenses/WTFPL.html) the current SPDX license list, I would say that the name should be `Do What The F*ck You Want To But It's Not My Fault Public License`. If there is interest in removing the asterisk from both this one and WTFPL, happy to discuss that  :)  but probably in a separate issue. It won't affect the ID in any case...","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3168594940/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3170645865","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2755#issuecomment-3170645865","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2755","id":3170645865,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE868_Ddp","user":{"login":"musicinmybrain","id":6898909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4OTg5MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6898909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/musicinmybrain","html_url":"https://github.com/musicinmybrain","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musicinmybrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musicinmybrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musicinmybrain/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musicinmybrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musicinmybrain/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musicinmybrain/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musicinmybrain/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musicinmybrain/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musicinmybrain/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-09T11:40:02Z","updated_at":"2025-08-09T11:40:02Z","body":"> [@xsuchy](https://github.com/xsuchy) [@musicinmybrain](https://github.com/musicinmybrain) - looking at the Bugzilla thread - are the files with this license header included in Fedora? If not, then we (and Fedora) probably don't need it. but then I also see that [@richardfontana](https://github.com/richardfontana) marked it as allowed for Fedora in the Gitlab issue.\n\nThe files are currently not included in the [`python-scipopt` package](https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/python-pyscipopt) because I use a [script](https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/python-pyscipopt/blob/fc9ffb3d9b08a8bc5b3ac758732a2dbeaf6d0034/f/get_source) to filter them out of the source archive before uploading to the lookaside cache, so that files not under an approved license are not distributed in the source RPMs. I can keep doing that indefinitely, but it would be great not to have to. I would also choose to ship these files along with the other examples in the `python-pyscipopt-examples` subpackage, so they would also appear in the binary RPMs – although this isn’t terribly important since they’re just documentation. [Here is how I would change the `python-pyscipopt` package](https://src.fedoraproject.org/rpms/python-pyscipopt/pull-request/1) if the SPDX ID were assigned.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3170645865/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3170647962","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2755#issuecomment-3170647962","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2755","id":3170647962,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE868_D-a","user":{"login":"musicinmybrain","id":6898909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4OTg5MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6898909?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/musicinmybrain","html_url":"https://github.com/musicinmybrain","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musicinmybrain/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musicinmybrain/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musicinmybrain/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musicinmybrain/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musicinmybrain/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musicinmybrain/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musicinmybrain/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musicinmybrain/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/musicinmybrain/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-09T11:44:27Z","updated_at":"2025-08-09T11:44:27Z","body":"> While I'm also personally fine with the proposed name, in order to align with past practices for [`WTFPL`](https://spdx.org/licenses/WTFPL.html) the current SPDX license list, I would say that the name should be `Do What The F*ck You Want To But It's Not My Fault Public License`. If there is interest in removing the asterisk from both this one and WTFPL, happy to discuss that :) but probably in a separate issue. It won't affect the ID in any case...\n\nGood point. I’m not sure why the license title was bowdlerized in the case of `WTFPL` – the original author certainly does not insert the asterisk – but I tend to agree that it’s probably best to handle these two closely-related licenses consistently.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3170647962/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/3170663571","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2755#issuecomment-3170663571","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2755","id":3170663571,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE868_HyT","user":{"login":"musicinmybrain","id":6898909,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4OTg5MDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6898909?v=4",